st still denies every capability."," "," Each Git package appears once per repository. Press **Space** to approve its pending commits, or **R** to include future commits. Press **Enter** to save. To approve a single revision, pass its full commit selector to `pnpm approve`. `--all` approves only pending commits."," ",""],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":264,"deletions":159,"truncated":false,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:23:59.564930+00:00"}